{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55607","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心地须教合死灰，藏机泯迹绝梯媒。\n芳兰只爲因香折，良木多从被直摧。\n寒逼花枝红未吐，日融水面绿全开。\n支颐独坐经窗下，一片云闲入户来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}